Description: Omit imported diagram metadata from the PDF manual
 Graphviz/Cairo PDF diagrams can contain wall-clock creation timestamps even
 when SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH is set. pdfTeX copies these into PTEX.InfoDict objects
 in the manual. Suppress that optional metadata when importing diagrams;
 retain the rendered content, links and the manual's own document metadata.
Author: Qore Technologies, s.r.o.
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-04
--- a/doc/doxygen_manual.tex
+++ b/doc/doxygen_manual.tex
@@ -17,2 +17,3 @@
 \pdfsuppresswarningpagegroup=1
+\pdfsuppressptexinfo=8
 \documentclass{book}
